=2 Walkthrough
* Proceed to the {z:Celennia Memorial Library} at (F-10) in {z:Eastern Adoulin}. Talk to {n:Eppel-Treppel} to enter the building.
* Read all three options in the book entitled **History** on the bookshelf. The section is between {n:Yefafa} and {n:Vainrachault}.
** If you are unable to read any books on the shelves, you will first need to complete the quest {q:Order Up|Order Up|Order Up} from {n:Reja Ygridhi}, who is located inside the library.
*** 1000 Bayld is required to purchase a {@k} {k:Celennia Memorial Library card} from {n:Patient Snake} ({z:Eastern Adoulin}, F-9) in order to start the quest. He is located at the end of the pathway leading to the interior of the Scouts' Coalition.
* Return to {n:Levil} in the {p:Pioneers' Coalition} in {z:Western Adoulin}.

